{
  "title": "Minutes of Love",
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "# Minutes of Love"
    },
    {
      "text": "[Intro]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Friday night at Rack ’Em",
      "time": 3.94
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe table number five",
      "time": 9.21
    },
    {
      "text": "[Verse 1]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Me and Don were shooting nine-ball",
      "time": 27.91
    },
    {
      "text": "Just to feel a little alive",
      "time": 31.05
    },
    {
      "text": "Four pretty girls came through the door",
      "time": 36.62
    },
    {
      "text": "Trouble dressed up right",
      "time": 41.85
    },
    {
      "text": "Terry had her eye on me",
      "time": 47.36
    },
    {
      "text": "But Tazia got the night",
      "time": 52.77
    },
    {
      "text": "Five days and four nights disappeared",
      "time": 57.82
    },
    {
      "text": "Without a goddamn trace",
      "time": 63.13
    },
    {
      "text": "Cheap coffee, busted automobiles",
      "time": 68.67
    },
    {
      "text": "And somebody else’s place",
      "time": 74.06
    },
    {
      "text": "We were twenty going forty",
      "time": 79.57
    },
    {
      "text": "Nineteen acting wise",
      "time": 85
    },
    {
      "text": "Trying hard to look dangerous",
      "time": 90.38
    },
    {
      "text": "With childhood in our eyes",
      "time": 95.87
    },
    {
      "text": "[Pre-Chorus]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Somewhere between the cue chalk",
      "time": 101.19
    },
    {
      "text": "And sunrise through the blinds",
      "time": 105.55
    },
    {
      "text": "A girl with dark brown eyes became",
      "time": 110.66
    },
    {
      "text": "A minute of my life",
      "time": 115.39
    },
    {
      "text": "[Chorus]"
    },
    {
      "text": "The minutes of love in my life",
      "time": 119.69
    },
    {
      "text": "Come back like headlights late at night",
      "time": 123.82
    },
    {
      "text": "A name, a face, a dashboard glow",
      "time": 130.42
    },
    {
      "text": "A hand I held a lifetime ago",
      "time": 135.28
    },
    {
      "text": "I don’t need ’em back",
      "time": 140.05
    },
    {
      "text": "I don’t need to make ’em right",
      "time": 142.04
    },
    {
      "text": "I just thank God for the minutes",
      "time": 146.12
    },
    {
      "text": "The minutes of love in my life",
      "time": 150.1
    },
    {
      "text": "[Verse 2]"
    },
    {
      "text": "She called me Bugsy for my teeth",
      "time": 156.92
    },
    {
      "text": "They called her Tazia",
      "time": 159.9
    },
    {
      "text": "Long dark hair and secondhand style",
      "time": 162.55
    },
    {
      "text": "Like some broke Fantasia",
      "time": 165.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Dreamcatchers hanging in the smoke",
      "time": 168.1
    },
    {
      "text": "Biker saints and everybody broke",
      "time": 170.27
    },
    {
      "text": "I wanted me a family",
      "time": 173.33
    },
    {
      "text": "That closed the circle tight",
      "time": 176.27
    },
    {
      "text": "And for a while they let me in",
      "time": 178.73
    },
    {
      "text": "Hell, I belonged there too",
      "time": 181.43
    },
    {
      "text": "Sometimes home ain’t where you’re from",
      "time": 184.2
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s who makes room for you",
      "time": 188.28
    },
    {
      "text": "[Verse 3]"
    },
    {
      "text": "We got a little house on Cherry Street",
      "time": 195.15
    },
    {
      "text": "One bedroom and a door",
      "time": 197.73
    },
    {
      "text": "We didn’t have a goddamn thing",
      "time": 200.05
    },
    {
      "text": "And, baby, we wanted more",
      "time": 203.13
    },
    {
      "text": "Her little sister needed somewhere",
      "time": 206
    },
    {
      "text": "So we opened up the place",
      "time": 209.02
    },
    {
      "text": "Then Mom moved into the garage",
      "time": 211.54
    },
    {
      "text": "And chaos joined the race",
      "time": 214.21
    },
    {
      "text": "Too many people, too many cats",
      "time": 216.87
    },
    {
      "text": "Too scared to draw the line",
      "time": 219.09
    },
    {
      "text": "So I packed my shit and walked away",
      "time": 221.75
    },
    {
      "text": "When I finally ran out of time",
      "time": 224.62
    },
    {
      "text": "[Break]"
    },
    {
      "text": "There wasn’t any villain",
      "time": 228.29
    },
    {
      "text": "There wasn’t some great crime",
      "time": 231.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Just two kids who loved each other",
      "time": 232.9
    },
    {
      "text": "Till we grew in different lines",
      "time": 236.33
    },
    {
      "text": "[Chorus]"
    },
    {
      "text": "The minutes of love in my life",
      "time": 241.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Come back like headlights late at night",
      "time": 246.06
    },
    {
      "text": "A name, a face, a dashboard glow",
      "time": 252.66
    },
    {
      "text": "A hand I held a lifetime ago",
      "time": 257.5
    },
    {
      "text": "I don’t need ’em back",
      "time": 262.34
    },
    {
      "text": "I don’t need to make ’em right",
      "time": 264.25
    },
    {
      "text": "I just thank God for the minutes",
      "time": 268.51
    },
    {
      "text": "The minutes of love in my life",
      "time": 272.82
    },
    {
      "text": "[Bridge]"
    },
    {
      "text": "I used to think that meaning",
      "time": 277.35
    },
    {
      "text": "Was somewhere up ahead",
      "time": 280.21
    },
    {
      "text": "In faster cars and hotter nights",
      "time": 282.2
    },
    {
      "text": "And all the lives I hadn’t lived yet",
      "time": 284.4
    },
    {
      "text": "But every road eventually",
      "time": 288.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Turns the traveler inside",
      "time": 290.37
    },
    {
      "text": "And all the love worth giving",
      "time": 293.41
    },
    {
      "text": "Has to have a home inside",
      "time": 295.95
    },
    {
      "text": "You cannot hold another heart",
      "time": 301.42
    },
    {
      "text": "More gently than your own",
      "time": 304.72
    },
    {
      "text": "And every woman that I loved",
      "time": 307.33
    },
    {
      "text": "Helped teach me how to come back home",
      "time": 309.61
    },
    {
      "text": "[Build]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tazia built a life herself",
      "time": 317.45
    },
    {
      "text": "Still down in Medford town",
      "time": 320.81
    },
    {
      "text": "And I smile when her name comes up",
      "time": 323.34
    },
    {
      "text": "At all the miles gone down",
      "time": 325.92
    },
    {
      "text": "No aching and no wishing",
      "time": 328.93
    },
    {
      "text": "No ending to regret",
      "time": 331.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Just gratitude for who we were",
      "time": 334.46
    },
    {
      "text": "And what we hadn’t learned yet",
      "time": 339.16
    },
    {
      "text": "[Final Chorus]"
    },
    {
      "text": "These minutes of love in my life",
      "time": 343.82
    },
    {
      "text": "They don’t belong to yesterday",
      "time": 348.2
    },
    {
      "text": "They made me more of who I am",
      "time": 353.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Then quietly gave me away",
      "time": 359.33
    },
    {
      "text": "No graves to dig",
      "time": 364.26
    },
    {
      "text": "No ghosts to fight",
      "time": 367.28
    },
    {
      "text": "No old wrongs left to make right",
      "time": 370.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Just names that glow",
      "time": 375.94
    },
    {
      "text": "When memory lights",
      "time": 378.79
    },
    {
      "text": "The minutes of love in my life",
      "time": 380.07
    },
    {
      "text": "[Outro]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Here’s to all the minutes",
      "time": 386.55
    },
    {
      "text": "Of love in my life",
      "time": 392.32
    }
  ]
}
